WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:01.848
Roxy bit her lip.

2
00:00:01.849 --> 00:00:05.008
"We have to stop the bank robber!"

3
00:00:05.009 --> 00:00:09.308
"Yes, but she probably won't rob again," Detective Smith said.

4
00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:12.272
"She already robbed every bank in the city!"

5
00:00:12.273 --> 00:00:16.498
Roxy sighed. "You're right."

6
00:00:16.499 --> 00:00:20.239
"There's one more place with money," Mrs. Betz said.

7
00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.975
"What's that?" Detective Smith asked.

8
00:00:22.976 --> 00:00:25.500
"The mint," Mrs. Betz said.

9
00:00:25.501 --> 00:00:27.855
"Of course!" Roxy said.

10
00:00:27.856 --> 00:00:30.372
"The robber will probably go there next.

11
00:00:30.373 --> 00:00:39.747
And I'll be waiting for her!"

12
00:00:39.748 --> 00:00:44.340
Roxy sat on a big pile of money in the mint.

13
00:00:44.341 --> 00:00:46.543
She waited and waited.

14
00:00:46.544 --> 00:00:49.459
Suddenly a small light formed on one wall.

15
00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:53.620
Roxy gasped. "A wormhole!"

16
00:00:53.621 --> 00:00:55.450
The light spun fast.

17
00:00:55.451 --> 00:00:57.037
It grew bigger.

18
00:00:57.038 --> 00:01:01.002
A woman stepped out of the wormhole.

19
00:01:01.003 --> 00:01:06.200
She grabbed some money and threw it through the wormhole.

20
00:01:06.201 --> 00:01:09.092
"Stop right there!" Roxy shouted.

21
00:01:09.093 --> 00:01:12.262
The woman looked up. "Rocket Girl!"

22
00:01:12.263 --> 00:01:14.422
Roxy flew toward the villain.

23
00:01:14.423 --> 00:01:16.439
The woman held up a blaster.

24
00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:20.917
Wha-zam! An energy blast knocked Roxy back.

25
00:01:20.918 --> 00:01:27.108
The villain jumped into the wormhole—and the wormhole disappeared!

26
00:01:27.109 --> 00:01:29.774
"Grr!" Roxy stamped her foot.

27
00:01:29.775 --> 00:01:34.659
"How will I catch the villain?"

28
00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:39.408
*** Terrell's phone rang. "Hello?" he

29
00:01:39.409 --> 00:01:41.774
whispered. "Terrell," Roxy

30
00:01:41.775 --> 00:01:43.980
said. "I'm trying to catch a bank

31
00:01:43.981 --> 00:01:48.637
robber. I need you to look up something for

32
00:01:48.638 --> 00:01:51.288
me—wormholes." Terrell did a quick search on his

33
00:01:51.289 --> 00:01:58.238
computer. "Hmm," he said. "A scientist at Metro City University does wormhole research.

34
00:01:58.239 --> 00:02:02.782
Her name is Dr. Vic Nebula. Maybe she can help you."

35
00:02:02.783 --> 00:02:12.255
"Good idea. Thanks!" Roxy said.

36
00:02:12.256 --> 00:02:17.951
Roxy arrived at the university and found Vic Nebula's lab.

37
00:02:17.952 --> 00:02:22.483
Roxy gasped. The lab was filled with money.

38
00:02:22.484 --> 00:02:26.006
"Dr. Nebula is the thief!" Roxy thought.

39
00:02:26.007 --> 00:02:29.021
The scientist stood in front of an open wormhole.

40
00:02:29.022 --> 00:02:35.778
She was holding a strange device. "Dr. Nebula!" Roxy said.

41
00:02:35.779 --> 00:02:39.621
Vic looked over. "Ugh! You're here!"

42
00:02:39.622 --> 00:02:41.807
Roxy put her hands on her hips.

43
00:02:41.808 --> 00:02:46.110
"You're a scientist. Why are you stealing money?"

44
00:02:46.111 --> 00:02:49.658
"I need a bigger lab for my research," Vic said.

45
00:02:49.659 --> 00:02:52.146
"I invented a wormhole device.

46
00:02:52.147 --> 00:02:57.111
When I'm done working on it, I'll be the most famous scientist ever."

47
00:02:57.112 --> 00:03:01.289
Roxy shook her head. "You're going to jail!"

48
00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:07.984
"No," Vic said. "I'm taking this money to a place where nobody will find it!"

49
00:03:07.985 --> 00:03:09.874
Roxy flew fast.

50
00:03:09.875 --> 00:03:12.414
Vic pressed a button on the device.

51
00:03:12.415 --> 00:03:15.855
A new wormhole appeared, and she jumped into it.

52
00:03:15.856 --> 00:03:18.816
She popped out of another wormhole behind Roxy.

53
00:03:18.817 --> 00:03:21.747
Roxy spun around and charged toward Vic.

54
00:03:21.748 --> 00:03:23.613
Vic stepped to the side.

55
00:03:23.614 --> 00:03:25.367
Roxy tried to stop.

56
00:03:25.368 --> 00:03:28.720
But she skidded—right into the wormhole!

57
00:03:28.721 --> 00:03:32.417
As the wormhole closed, Vic laughed.

58
00:03:32.418 --> 00:03:37.120
"Now nobody will ever find Rocket Girl!"

